
# machine translated (Spanish), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Red note when a folder is shared and Trindle's own helper is not on this computer.
folders-alone-no-share = Compartir una carpeta necesita un programa auxiliar de Trindle que no está instalado.

# Note when a Windows share is opened and Trindle's own helper is not on this computer.
folders-alone-no-mount = Abrir un recurso compartido de Windows necesita un programa auxiliar de Trindle que no está instalado.

# Note when an NFS export is opened and Trindle's own helper is not on this computer.
folders-alone-no-nfs = Abrir un recurso compartido NFS necesita un programa auxiliar de Trindle que no está instalado.

# Red note when the wallpaper is set from Folders and Trindle's wallpaper program is not on this computer.
folders-alone-no-wallpaper = Cambiar el fondo de pantalla necesita el programa de fondos de Trindle, que no está instalado.

# Red note when a folder is opened as administrator and the program that asks for the administrator password is not on this computer.
folders-alone-no-root = Abrir una carpeta como administrador necesita pkexec, que no está instalado.

# Red note when a folder is shared with AI programs and Trindle's program for that is not on this computer.
folders-alone-no-ai = Compartir con programas de IA necesita un programa de Trindle que no está instalado.

# Red note when a folder is opened in a terminal and none is installed.
folders-alone-no-terminal = No hay ningún terminal instalado para abrir esta carpeta.

